# Peticiones de prueba para la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code.
#  1. Arranca la API:            flask run --debug
#  2. Datos de ejemplo:          flask seed-demo tu_correo@gmail.com
#  3. Obtén un token:            flask dev-token tu_correo@gmail.com
#  4. Pega el token en @token y pulsa "Send Request" sobre cada petición.

@base = http://127.0.0.1:5000/api
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN
@vehicle = 1

### Estado de la API
GET {{base}}/health

### Mi usuario
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tipos de mantenimiento
GET {{base}}/maintenance-types

### ---------- Vehículos ----------

### Mis vehículos
GET {{base}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar vehículo
POST {{base}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "make": "Honda",
  "model": "Civic",
  "year": 2020,
  "plate": "P987-654",
  "color": "Azul",
  "initial_mileage": 30000
}

### Editar vehículo
PUT {{base}}/vehicles/{{vehicle}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "color": "Negro" }

### ---------- Registrar ----------
# Ajusta fecha y millas a tus datos: el odómetro no puede retroceder.

### Registrar cambio de aceite
POST {{base}}/vehicles/{{vehicle}}/maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "oil_change",
  "date": "2026-10-17",
  "mileage": 63000,
  "cost": 45.00,
  "notes": "Aceite 5W-30 sintético"
}

### Registrar carga de combustible
POST {{base}}/vehicles/{{vehicle}}/fuel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-18",
  "mileage": 63150,
  "gallons": 9.5,
  "total_cost": 38.40,
  "full_tank": true
}

### ---------- Consultar ----------

### Cambios de aceite de este año
GET {{base}}/vehicles/{{vehicle}}/maintenance?type=oil_change&from=2026-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cargas de combustible
GET {{base}}/vehicles/{{vehicle}}/fuel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Estado general ----------

### Semáforo de mantenimientos
GET {{base}}/vehicles/{{vehicle}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rendimiento y gastos
GET {{base}}/vehicles/{{vehicle}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Intervalos de mantenimiento
GET {{base}}/vehicles/{{vehicle}}/intervals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambiar el intervalo del aceite a 7,500 millas
PUT {{base}}/vehicles/{{vehicle}}/intervals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{ "type": "oil_change", "every_miles": 7500, "every_months": 6 }]
